architecture-beta
group cloud(cloud)[AWS Cloud]
group region(cloud)[Europe West 2] in cloud
group vpc(cloud)[Production VPC] in region
service api(server)[API Gateway] in vpc
service app(server)[Application] in vpc
service database_primary(database)[Database] in vpc
service database_replica(database)[Database] in vpc
junction split in vpc
api:R --> L:app
app:R --> L:split
split:B -- T:database_primary
app:B --> T:database_replica
database_primary:L <--> R:database_replica
